{
  "batch_id": "s1:batch:0010",
  "translations": [
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00746",
      "en": "Come to think of it, when we left Lewinia, Levia",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00747",
      "en": "that the currency used in this town is different.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00754",
      "en": "Oh, in this town you can't use Rudra.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00761",
      "en": "I'll go exchange it.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00768",
      "en": "No way.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00775",
      "en": "Huh?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00782",
      "en": "Three days ago, the Lewinian army came,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00783",
      "en": "and they all exchanged currency, so",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00784",
      "en": "the exchange's vault got filled with Rudra.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00791",
      "en": "What!",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00798",
      "en": "So yesterday, all the exchange staff,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00799",
      "en": "said they'd go exchange in another town and left.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00806",
      "en": "That's...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00808",
      "en": "I put a hand on the flustered Shuri's shoulder and",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00809",
      "en": "stepped forward to Rinsha the innkeeper.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00812",
      "en": "Ah, Master...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00815",
      "en": "Can you pay with this?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00817",
      "en": "I pulled a jewel from my pocket and held it out.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00824",
      "en": "What's this? A jewel?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00826",
      "en": "No wonder she's surprised. It's redder than blood,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00827",
      "en": "The jewel shines clear without a single cloud,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00828",
      "en": "and is larger than her wide-open eyes.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00830",
      "en": "I think it was enough to live idly for a year.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00833",
      "en": "You planning to buy the whole inn?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00836",
      "en": "I have no such intention.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00839",
      "en": "Then... I can't accept such a precious jewel.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00842",
      "en": "Then treat it as a deposit.",
      "notes": ""
    }
  ],
